==Malay==
{{wikipedia|lang=ms}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ms|kuching}} {{q|British colonies, pre-1972}}
* {{l|id|koetjing}} {{q|Dutch Indies, pre-1947}}
* {{l|id|kutjing}} {{q|Indonesia, 1947-1967}}

===Etymology===
From [[w:Western Malayo-Polynesian languages|Proto Western Malayo-Polynesian]] {{m|poz-pro|*kutíŋ}}. The history of this term is unclear. Although ''kucing'' applies almost exclusively to domestic cats today, it may have had earlier applications to wild felines.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Johor-Selangor|Riau-Lingga}} {{IPA|ms|/kut͡ʃeŋ/}}
* {{a|Baku}} {{IPA|ms|/kut͡ʃɪŋ/}}
* {{rhymes|ms|ut͡ʃeŋ}}
* {{rhymes|ms|iŋ|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{ms-noun|j=کوچيڠ}}

# [[cat]] {{gloss|domestic species}}
#: {{ux|ms|'''Kucing''' saya berwarna kelabu.| My '''cat''' is gray.}}

